<title>UK: Goldman Sachs sets warrants on Allianz.</title>
<headline>Goldman Sachs sets warrants on Allianz.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs &amp; Co Wertpapier GmbH has issued five million American-style call warrants on Allianz registered shares, lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co said.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 100 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    2800 DEM		  PREMIUM	10.35 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     2.81 DEM		  GEARING	9.94 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 14.NOV.96-08.MAY.98   PAYDATE	13.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   DUSS, FRFT, STUTT     MIN EXER LOT =</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  2792 DEM</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
